  "cited_article_id": "troubleshoot-lab-interface",
  "reply": "Please have a System Administrator open Admin > Interfaces > Lab Connectivity, run the Diagnostics ping, and if the status is offline click Action > Restart Service. Wait three minutes for the queue to flush and refresh the dashboard. If the status remains red, confirm that your firewall allows outbound traffic on port 443 to the gateway IP, then capture the error code from the event log and include the specimen requisition numbers in a support ticket."
}
